# Build with Ninja

After `cmake -B build` has been run once, build from the **repository root** with Ninja:

```bash
ninja -C build                      # full default build
ninja -C build transmission-gtk     # GTK client
ninja -C build transmission-daemon
ninja -C build transmission-qt
ninja -C build transmission-mac     # macOS
```

Do not `cd build` for compile steps unless running binaries or `ctest`.
